### CRIT-002 — Weak JWT Secret Key

**Severity:** 🔴 Critical  
**Category:** Security  
**Location:** [config.py:30](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/backend/app/config.py#L30), [.env:10](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/.env#L10)

**Problem:** The JWT `SECRET_KEY` is set to `lifeos-dev-secret-key-change-in-production-2024`. This is a guessable, developer-facing string. Anyone who guesses or reads this can forge JWT tokens for any user, including admins.

**Recommended fix:** Generate a cryptographically random key: `python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(64))"`

**Production impact:** Complete authentication bypass — any attacker can create admin tokens

