### CRIT-006 — No Rate Limiting on Any Endpoint

**Severity:** 🔴 Critical  
**Category:** Security  
**Location:** Entire application — no rate limiter middleware found

**Problem:** There is zero rate limiting on:
- `/auth/login` — allows unlimited brute-force attempts
- `/auth/forgot-password` — allows email bombing
- `/auth/register` — allows mass account creation
- `/ai/chat` — allows unlimited Groq API consumption (financial risk)
- `/ai/symptoms/analyze` — allows abuse of AI resources

**Recommended fix:** Add `slowapi` or custom rate limiting middleware. At minimum: 5 login attempts/minute per IP, 10 AI requests/minute per user.

**Production impact:** Brute-force attacks, denial of service, AI API cost explosion

