### HIGH-001 — No IDOR Protection on Admin "Login As User" Endpoint

**Severity:** 🟠 High  
**Category:** Authorization  
**Location:** [admin.py](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/backend/app/routers/admin.py) — `POST /admin/users/{userId}/login-as`

**Problem:** An admin can generate tokens for any user. If the admin role check is bypassed or an admin account is compromised, an attacker can impersonate any patient.

