### HIGH-004 — Public AI Chat Endpoint Has No Authentication

**Severity:** 🟠 High  
**Category:** Security / Financial  
**Location:** [ai_assistant.py:76-84](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/backend/app/routers/ai_assistant.py#L76-L84)

**Problem:** `POST /ai/chat/public` requires no authentication. Anyone can send unlimited messages, consuming Groq API credits. Combined with no rate limiting (CRIT-006), this is a direct financial attack vector.

