### HIGH-005 — `resend-verification` Calls Email Synchronously (Blocks Request)

**Severity:** 🟠 High  
**Category:** Performance / Reliability  
**Location:** [auth.py:418](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/backend/app/routers/auth.py#L418)

**Problem:** `send_verification_email(data.email, code)` is called synchronously (not wrapped in `asyncio.create_task` like other email calls). This blocks the request until the SMTP call completes or times out (potentially 30+ seconds).

