### HIGH-006 — IP Blocking Middleware Opens New DB Session Per Request

**Severity:** 🟠 High  
**Category:** Performance  
**Location:** [middleware.py:51-75](file:///g:/Languages/Projects/Healthcare%20AI/R1/backend/app/middleware.py#L51-L75)

**Problem:** The `ip_blocking_middleware` creates a new `AsyncSessionLocal()` database session for **every single HTTP request** to check if the IP is blocked. This is extremely wasteful — it adds a full DB round-trip to every request.

**Recommended fix:** Cache blocked IPs in memory with a TTL (e.g., using `cachetools`), refreshing every 60 seconds.

